# 🖨️ Printer Fundamentals

Printers are one of the most common examples of Help Desk support tickets.

Basic printer types include:

## Inkjet

Uses liquid ink cartridges.

Commonly found in:

* Home environments
* Small offices

---

## Laser

Uses toner and a laser-based printing process.

Commonly used in:

* Business environments
* Office printers

Laser printers are generally designed for high-volume document printing.

---

## Thermal

Uses heat-sensitive printing methods.

Often used in:

* Receipts
* Labels
* Specialized printing systems

For entry-level IT Support, understanding the purpose and basic troubleshooting approach is more important than memorizing internal printer mechanics.

