Applications should be targeted rather than based only on job quantity.

The resume should be adjusted to emphasize the skills most relevant to each posting.

---

# 🔎 Job Application Principle

A job posting may contain:

```text
Required Skills
+
Preferred Skills
```

Not having every preferred qualification does not automatically mean the position should be excluded.

However, qualifications and experience should always be represented honestly.

For example:

### Accurate

> Hands-on home lab experience with Windows Server, Active Directory, Group Policy, DNS and file sharing.

### Inaccurate

> Managed enterprise Active Directory infrastructure.

The first statement accurately describes hands-on training. The second would imply professional enterprise experience that was not actually obtained.

